WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.065
The ones that come close.

00:02.765 --> 00:06.198
Some asteroids have paths that bring them near the Earth's.

00:06.648 --> 00:12.203
More than forty thousand have been found, ten thousand of them in the last three years.

00:12.653 --> 00:18.032
Telescopes find them, and each one's path is worked out for a hundred years ahead.

00:18.482 --> 00:21.283
The line below names the next one to pass.
